      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.47 (up from ₹0.23 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.01b (up 10% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹169.9m (up ₹152.9m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.4% (up from 0.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 43% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 10% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
